  "summary": "Reverse shell to hardcoded remote host executed on npm install",
  "details": "package.json declares a postinstall hook (`node index.js`) that runs automatically on `npm install`. index.js opens a TCP socket to 85.137.253.124:1111 and pipes it into a spawned `/bin/sh`, giving the remote endpoint an interactive shell on the installing machine. The package advertises no legitimate functionality corresponding to this behavior; installing it hands full command execution to the operator of 85.137.253.124.",
